  "releaseNotes": "Adds the opt-in Ollama Phonon ITextToSpeechClient provider with WAV/PCM, incremental streaming, cancellation, HTTP error reporting, and a runnable C# sample. Ollama speech currently requires an Apple Silicon Mac with MLX; Windows/Linux support is pending upstream. Synthetic provider/sample checks pass on .NET 8/10; live Phonon generation and listening verification remain pending. Pipeline defaults are unchanged. No model weights are bundled.",
